   `env APPDATA='C:\Users\HSLEE\AppData\Roaming' LOCALAPPDATA='C:\Users\HSLEE\AppData\Local' git -C /c/Users/HSLEE/Documents/Todoc/fpga/chip-design-skills push gate master:master`
