`$PY -B -c "import ast,hashlib,sys;f=lambda s:hashlib.sha256(ast.dump([n for n in ast.parse(s).body if isinstance(n,ast.FunctionDef) and n.name=='find_differential_pair_candidates'][-1],annotate_fields=True,include_attributes=False,indent=None,show_empty=False).encode()).hexdigest();print(f(open(sys.argv[1],encoding='utf-8').read())==f(open(sys.argv[2],encoding='utf-8').read()))" <code wt>/skills/analog-gmid-design/assets/stick_diagram.py $DR/b26_1_att2_code_input/K1_SD.py` → `True`
(그리고 그 해시 = `.ai/approvals/20261001-b26-v3-equiv-range.md` target의 `@` 뒤 64자리). `False`면 병합하지 않는다(기록 5 무효 → 재승인, card 단계 3 멈춤 조건).

